      "en": "### Core Songs\n\nWalking Walking  \nCount & Move  \nLet's Go To The Zoo  \nHello Hello! Can You Clap Your Hands  \nOpen Shut Them  \nThe Pinocchio  \nWalking In The Jungle  \nPass the Beanbag  \nWe All Fall Down  \nHead Shoulders Knees & Toes\n\n### Use of Songs\n\nSongs should support movement cues, go/stop routines, walking, jumping, dancing, clapping, body coordination, passing, falling/resting safely, and group rhythm. Children may listen, move, stop, clap, jump, dance, pass a beanbag, hold a scarf, or copy one repeated action. Singing is optional and not required.",
